	(text "Notes:\n* Place C2 so that it sees minimal bending\n* Parallel TVS needed to survive IEC 61000-4-5 surge at 0.5 kV line-line\n  (2 Ω, 1.2/50-8/20 µs; IACS UR E10 level)\n\nTrip Point 3A Config;\n* F1 - Bel Fuse 0679L3000-05 (3A Fast Blow)\n* R6 - Vishay RCWE120687L0FKEA (27mΩ, min 1.48A / typ 1.85A / max 2.22A)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
